1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,850
It just looked back at you.

2
00:00:03,150 --> 00:00:04,350
All day, you talk to AI in a chat box.

3
00:00:04,650 --> 00:00:07,350
SOUL gives it a face on your desk, and the
answer lands on the glass.

4
00:00:07,650 --> 00:00:09,850
And it smiles back.

5
00:00:10,150 --> 00:00:12,350
Claude works in the Claude app.

6
00:00:12,650 --> 00:00:15,350
When it needs a yes, SOUL looks up at you.
Hold to allow.

7
00:00:15,650 --> 00:00:18,350
(founder) I'm [name]. I build SOUL in
Bucharest.

8
00:00:18,650 --> 00:00:21,850
(founder) I wanted the AI I already use to
have a face I can hold.

9
00:00:22,150 --> 00:00:25,350
(founder) One that never watches you, and
never stops working because a server went
away.

10
00:00:25,650 --> 00:00:28,350
It blinks when it wants to. It follows
your finger.

11
00:00:28,650 --> 00:00:31,350
Leave it alone, it dozes off. Shake it, it
gets dizzy.

12
00:00:31,650 --> 00:00:33,850
120 eyes. One is yours.

13
00:00:34,150 --> 00:00:36,350
Born from its chip. Nobody picks them.

14
00:00:36,650 --> 00:00:39,350
Your own Claude, your own OpenAI key, or
no AI at all.

15
00:00:39,650 --> 00:00:41,850
Offline, it's still alive.

16
00:00:42,150 --> 00:00:44,850
Hold the glass to talk. Let go, and it
stops listening.

17
00:00:45,150 --> 00:00:47,850
The eyes lead the whole OS.

18
00:00:48,150 --> 00:00:50,850
Notes, alarms, focus. All on the stone.

19
00:00:51,150 --> 00:00:53,350
Machined aluminium, bead-blasted,
anodised.

20
00:00:53,650 --> 00:00:56,350
SOUL S is 63 by 71 millimetres.

21
00:00:56,650 --> 00:00:58,850
It sits in your palm.

22
00:00:59,150 --> 00:01:01,850
Three colours, one price.

23
00:01:02,150 --> 00:01:04,350
At night it sleeps in its egg, and
charges.

24
00:01:04,650 --> 00:01:06,850
No camera. Its memory stays on the device.

25
00:01:07,150 --> 00:01:09,850
The first 150 are €249. Then €269.

26
00:01:10,150 --> 00:01:12,850
All or nothing, on Indiegogo. Estimated
delivery May 2028.

27
00:01:13,150 --> 00:01:15,850
Back SOUL on Indiegogo.
